""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:startLine 105.
<urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l107-o0> a aat:Heading;
    aat:addressLabel "delivery-service";
    aat:contentEndLine 118;
    aat:contentStartLine 110;
    aat:endLine 119;
    aat:headingLevel 2;
    aat:headingLine 108;
    aat:headline "配送服务";
    aat:layer "业务";
    aat:metadataEndLine 107;
    aat:metadataStartLine 107;
    aat:port "8104";
    aat:raw """[#delivery-service.section, layer=业务, runtime=python, port=8104, team=logistics]
=== 配送服务

配送服务负责骑手调度和配送路线规划。

消费 `OrderConfirmed` 事件后，根据餐厅位置和收货地址匹配可用骑手。
骑手位置数据实时写入 xref:redis[Redis 缓存, rel=depends-on]，供前端轮询展示。

配送服务同步调用 xref:user-service[用户服务, rel=queries] 获取骑手信息，
同步调用 xref:restaurant-service[餐厅服务, rel=queries] 获取餐厅位置。
配送完成后发布 `DeliveryCompleted` 事件至 xref:message-queue[消息队列, rel=publishes-to]，
xref:notification-service[通知服务, rel=subscribes-to] 消费该事件向消费者推送送达通知。

""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:role "section";
    aat:runtime "python";
    aat:startLine 107;
    aat:team "logistics";
    rel:depends-on <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l164-o0>;
    rel:publishes-to <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l169-o0>;
