    aat:raw """[#message-queue.section, layer=基础设施, runtime=rabbitmq, team=platform]
=== 消息队列

RabbitMQ 实例，承担异步事件传递。
所有业务事件通过 topic exchange 路由，各服务以独立队列订阅。
消息持久化启用，确保 broker 重启不丢失事件。

""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:role "section";
    aat:runtime "rabbitmq";
    aat:startLine 169;
    aat:team "platform".
<urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l17-o0> a aat:Heading;
    aat:containsDirectly <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l19-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l34-o0>;
    aat:endLine 18;
    aat:generatedAddressLabel "入口层";
    aat:headingLevel 1;
    aat:headingLine 17;
    aat:headline "入口层";
    aat:previousSibling <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l8-o0>;
    aat:raw """== 入口层

""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:startLine 17.
<urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l176-o0> a aat:Heading;
    aat:contentEndLine 192;
    aat:contentStartLine 178;
    aat:endLine 193;
    aat:generatedAddressLabel "部署与依赖约束";
    aat:headingLevel 1;
    aat:headingLine 176;
    aat:headline "部署与依赖约束";
    aat:previousSibling <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l137-o0>;
    aat:raw """== 部署与依赖约束

服务部署遵循以下约束：

1. 基础设施层（数据库、Redis、RabbitMQ）必须先于业务层启动。
2. xref:auth-service[认证服务, rel=precedes] 必须先于 xref:api-gateway[API 网关, rel=precedes] 启动，
   因为网关依赖认证服务校验令牌。
3. xref:user-service[用户服务, rel=precedes] 和 xref:restaurant-service[餐厅服务, rel=precedes]
   必须先于 xref:order-service[订单服务, rel=precedes] 启动，
   因为订单创建时需要同步调用这两个服务做校验。
4. xref:order-service[订单服务, rel=precedes] 必须先于 xref:delivery-service[配送服务, rel=precedes] 和
   xref:payment-service[支付服务, rel=precedes] 启动，
   因为后两者消费订单服务发布的事件。
5. xref:notification-service[通知服务, rel=precedes] 无启动顺序约束，
   因为它是纯事件消费者，晚启动只是延迟处理，不影响正确性。

推荐启动顺序：数据库 → Redis → RabbitMQ → 认证服务 → 用户服务 → 餐厅服务 → 订单服务 → 支付服务 → 配送服务 → 通知服务 → API 网关。

""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:startLine 176;
    rel:precedes <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l107-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l122-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l19-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l34-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l45-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l56-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l70-o0>.
<urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l19-o0> a aat:Heading;
    aat:addressLabel "api-gateway";
    aat:contentEndLine 32;
    aat:contentStartLine 22;
    aat:endLine 33;
    aat:headingLevel 2;
    aat:headingLine 20;
    aat:headline "API 网关";
    aat:layer "入口";
    aat:metadataEndLine 19;
    aat:metadataStartLine 19;
    aat:port "8080";
    aat:raw """[#api-gateway.section, layer=入口, runtime=go, port=8080, team=platform]
=== API 网关

API 网关是系统的统一入口，基于 Kong 构建。
负责请求路由、身份验证令牌校验、限流和熔断。

所有外部 HTTP 请求经由网关转发至后端业务服务。
网关将 `/api/users/**` 路由至 xref:user-service[用户服务, rel=routes-to]，
`/api/orders/**` 路由至 xref:order-service[订单服务, rel=routes-to]，
`/api/restaurants/**` 路由至 xref:restaurant-service[餐厅服务, rel=routes-to]，
`/api/deliveries/**` 路由至 xref:delivery-service[配送服务, rel=routes-to]。

网关依赖 xref:auth-service[认证服务, rel=depends-on] 验证 JWT 令牌的有效性，
依赖 xref:redis[Redis 缓存, rel=depends-on] 存储限流计数和路由表热配置。

""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:role "section";
    aat:runtime "go";
    aat:startLine 19;
    aat:team "platform";
    rel:depends-on <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l164-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l34-o0>;
    rel:routes-to <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l107-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l45-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l56-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l70-o0>.
<urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l34-o0> a aat:Heading;
    aat:addressLabel "auth-service";
    aat:contentEndLine 41;
    aat:contentStartLine 37;
    aat:endLine 42;
    aat:headingLevel 2;
    aat:headingLine 35;
    aat:headline "认证服务";
    aat:layer "入口";
    aat:metadataEndLine 34;
    aat:metadataStartLine 34;
    aat:port "8081";
    aat:previousSibling <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l19-o0>;
    aat:raw """[#auth-service.section, layer=入口, runtime=go, port=8081, team=platform]
=== 认证服务

认证服务负责用户身份验证和令牌签发。
支持邮箱密码登录和 OAuth2 社交登录两种方式。

登录成功后签发 JWT Access Token（有效期 15 分钟）和 Refresh Token（有效期 7 天）。
令牌的签发和校验依赖 xref:redis[Redis 缓存, rel=depends-on] 存储令牌黑名单和刷新令牌映射。

""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:role "section";
    aat:runtime "go";
    aat:startLine 34;
    aat:team "platform";
    rel:depends-on <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l164-o0>.
<urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l43-o0> a aat:Heading;
    aat:containsDirectly <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l45-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l56-o0>;
