    aat:headline "业务层：用户与餐厅";
    aat:previousSibling <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l17-o0>;
    aat:raw """== 业务层：用户与餐厅

""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:startLine 43.
<urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l45-o0> a aat:Heading;
    aat:addressLabel "user-service";
    aat:contentEndLine 54;
    aat:contentStartLine 48;
    aat:endLine 55;
    aat:headingLevel 2;
    aat:headingLine 46;
    aat:headline "用户服务";
    aat:layer "业务";
    aat:metadataEndLine 45;
    aat:metadataStartLine 45;
    aat:port "8100";
    aat:raw """[#user-service.section, layer=业务, runtime=java, port=8100, team=account]
=== 用户服务

用户服务管理消费者和骑手的账户信息。
职责包括：注册、登录（委托 xref:auth-service[认证服务, rel=delegates-to]）、个人资料维护、收货地址管理。

用户数据持久化至 xref:user-db[用户数据库, rel=depends-on]。
会话数据和登录频率限制缓存在 xref:redis[Redis 缓存, rel=depends-on] 中。
用户注册成功后，向 xref:message-queue[消息队列, rel=publishes-to] 发布 `UserRegistered` 事件，
xref:notification-service[通知服务, rel=subscribes-to] 消费该事件发送欢迎邮件。

""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:role "section";
    aat:runtime "java";
    aat:startLine 45;
    aat:team "account";
    rel:delegates-to <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l34-o0>;
    rel:depends-on <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l139-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l164-o0>;
    rel:publishes-to <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l169-o0>;
    rel:subscribes-to <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l122-o0>.
<urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l56-o0> a aat:Heading;
    aat:addressLabel "restaurant-service";
    aat:contentEndLine 66;
    aat:contentStartLine 59;
    aat:endLine 67;
    aat:headingLevel 2;
    aat:headingLine 57;
    aat:headline "餐厅服务";
    aat:layer "业务";
    aat:metadataEndLine 56;
    aat:metadataStartLine 56;
    aat:port "8101";
    aat:previousSibling <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l45-o0>;
    aat:raw """[#restaurant-service.section, layer=业务, runtime=java, port=8101, team=catalog]
=== 餐厅服务

餐厅服务管理合作餐厅的菜单、营业状态和地理位置信息。

餐厅和菜单数据持久化至 xref:restaurant-db[餐厅数据库, rel=depends-on]。
热门餐厅的菜单详情缓存在 xref:redis[Redis 缓存, rel=depends-on] 中，缓存 TTL 为 10 分钟。

餐厅服务通过 REST API 向 xref:order-service[订单服务, rel=queries] 提供菜单查询和价格校验能力。
当餐厅更新菜单时，向 xref:message-queue[消息队列, rel=publishes-to] 发布 `MenuUpdated` 事件，
通知下游服务刷新缓存。

""";
    aat:relativePath "document.adoc";
    aat:role "section";
    aat:runtime "java";
    aat:startLine 56;
    aat:team "catalog";
    rel:depends-on <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l144-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:cb2326f19571d90604fdc849e1feae1baf446791ecbd64bcba2520c45cc0c1be#heading-l164-o0>;
